        "Vaccinations",
        "Core and lifestyle vaccinations for puppies, kittens and adult pets, with clear reminders when boosters are due.",
        "Dental Care",
        "Dental checks, scale and polish, and extractions carried out under close monitoring by experienced staff.",
        "Neutering & Surgery",
        "Routine neutering through to soft-tissue surgery, performed in our purpose-built theatre.",
